Use: This script brings information about the list when you click on it twice. It also has a function that updates the listing property, editing this property in the graphic interface or changing the variable value in the text block.
Click the right mouse button on any list of the list. Choose the “Listing Details” in the menu that appears. The menu will expand and include a box filled with details of the list. Then you can expand these elements as much as you want to see detailed information. When you start to press twice to get more information, you will need a “sharing of the window”. Do this in the upper left corner, right above the program icon. Thus, you can look at all the open things on one screen without returning to different windows, which is tiring.
